<title>AUSTRIA: Indonesia supports OPEC output rollover.</title>
<headline>Indonesia supports OPEC output rollover.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian oil minister Ida Bagus Sudjana said on Wednesday that he supported a rollover of OPEC's output ceiling.</p>
<p>In reply to a reporter's question whether it was best for the group if the ceiling was unchanged the minister said &quot;I think so.&quot;</p>
<p>He also said he saw &quot;no problem&quot; with the return of Iraqi oil exports to the market.</p>
<p>&quot;We try to maintain the market especially for the price of the oil,&quot; Sudjana added.</p>
</text>
